+      # 1. THE BUILD'S EXIT STATUS IS THE HOOK'S EXIT STATUS. The chain used to
+      #    end `git checkout -- docs/webvowl/data/ontology.json || true`, and a
+      #    shell returns the status of the last command in the list, so the hook
+      #    returned that `|| true` and exited 0 for every build — including
+      #    failing ones. The gate had therefore never failed for anybody since
